  "data": {
    "id": 6434,
    "type": 10,
    "mode": 0,
    "title": "Orange 20 Listening - Test 2 - Listening Passage 4",
    "status": "published",
    "time": 9,
    "quiz_code": "",
    "parts": [
      {
        "id": 6481,
        "quiz_id": 6380,
        "passage": 4,
        "title": "Listening Passage 4",
        "sort": 4,
        "content": "",
        "explanations": [],
        "questions": [],
        "vocabs": [
          {
            "id": 1722488,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 1722489,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "There are trends in food, much as there are trends in clothing.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 91.19,
                  "from": 86.15,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 1722502,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Interest in food fashions has risen rapidly since the birth of the smartphone, when people first began taking photos of their food and instantly sharing them with their friends.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 105.515,
                  "from": 91.91,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 1722532,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "The food industry in the UK, in particular, is obsessed with finding and exploiting the next big food trend.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 116.14,
                  "from": 106.155,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 1722552,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Marketers aim to create a huge demand for a food item which was previously unknown or not needed.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 125.020004,
                  "from": 116.86,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 1722568,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "One of the most effective ways of promoting a new food product is by using social media influencers as brand ambassadors.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 135.99501,
                  "from": 126.395004,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 1722589,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "In return for free samples, many influencers will post content about a product, although there are influencers with hundreds of thousands of followers who can command large fees for their services.",
                "youpass_pick_words": [
                  "command"
                ],
                "meta": {
                  "to": 150.79001,
                  "from": 136.55501,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 1722619,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Companies which sell vegan produce were pioneers in being able to increase sales really quickly in this way.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 160.015,
                  "from": 151.935,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 1722638,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 1722639,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "For a food item to become really popular, it has to be readily available.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 166.735,
                  "from": 161.215,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 1722653,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "So supermarkets have a role to play in creating a new food trend.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 172.61,
                  "from": 167.40999,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 1722664,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "They have dedicated teams closely following which new products or ingredients are trending on social media and are particularly interested in what well-known chefs are putting on their menus.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 187.76501,
                  "from": 173.25,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 1722693,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 1722694,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "I’d like to look at a few examples of marketing campaigns which were really successful in launching a new fashion trend.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 201.75,
                  "from": 188.565,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 1722714,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 1722715,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Starting in the 1990s with the avocado.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 206.47,
                  "from": 202.62999,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 1722723,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "A British PR company was hired to raise its profile and stimulate demand.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 213.035,
                  "from": 207.03,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 1722736,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "They paid for a group of journalists to travel out to South Africa to meet avocado farmers.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 221.355,
                  "from": 213.675,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 1722753,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Articles written following this visit helped to educate the British public about the avocado, which at this time was certainly not the daily staple it’s since become.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 234.97,
                  "from": 222.57,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 1722781,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Advertisements were designed to promote the avocado as a superfood, rich in nutrients, and therefore beneficial for health.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 246.85501,
                  "from": 236.77501,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 1722799,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Avocados became hugely fashionable, and within a few years, UK avocado sales had grown from 13 million pounds annually to around 150 million, making it one of the most successful fresh produce campaigns in UK history.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 256.41,
                  "from": 247.57501,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 1722836,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 1722837,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Oat milk is a recent example of a new product which became fashionable very quickly.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 276.505,
                  "from": 270.10498,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 1722851,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Now, there are many brands available, but one company which had early success was the Swedish brand, Oatly.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 286.42,
                  "from": 277.54,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 1722869,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "They attracted a lot of attention with a media campaign which used provocation as a way of getting their message across effectively.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 296.67502,
                  "from": 287.13998,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 1722889,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "The fact that this campaign aggravated competitors producing milk from dairy cows was seen as a plus, as it helped to make oat milk seem cool.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 309.81,
                  "from": 297.315,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 1722915,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 1722916,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "In the USA, the brand decided against a big retail launch in favor of getting the product into coffee chains, which removed the need for a big advertising budget.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 324.465,
                  "from": 310.93,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 1722944,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "This proved far more effective than offering samples in supermarkets.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 329.665,
                  "from": 325.025,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 1722955,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Oat milk had an advantage over other alternative milk products, such as almond milk.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 337.74,
                  "from": 331.1,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 1722970,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Many consumers prefer it because it has less of an impact on the environment.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 343.66,
                  "from": 338.54,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 1722984,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "It requires significantly less water to produce than other alternative milk products, and it also has a relatively low carbon footprint.",
                "youpass_pick_words": [
                  "footprint"
                ],
                "meta": {
                  "to": 355.055,
                  "from": 344.57498,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 1723005,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 1723006,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Norwegian Skrei, a rarely available seasonal fish delicacy, otherwise known as Arctic cod, is now found on the menus of Michelin-starred restaurants throughout Europe.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 370.67,
                  "from": 357.55,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 1723030,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "The demand for skrei has been used by a food marketing agency to build the reputation of Norway’s fisheries in general.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 381.005,
                  "from": 371.565,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 1723051,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Marketing surveys have shown that a significant number of shoppers now associate Norway with excellent seafood.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 390.04,
                  "from": 381.965,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 1723067,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 1723068,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Food trends can be considered a good thing in some ways, as they can benefit farmers and food producers enormously.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 401.175,
                  "from": 391.4,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 1723088,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "The public can also be encouraged to buy things which are more sustainably produced.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 407.735,
                  "from": 401.97498,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 1723103,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "But ethical concerns have been raised about the effects a surge in demand can cause.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 415.0,
                  "from": 408.6,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 1723118,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Quinoa is a classic example.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 418.12,
                  "from": 415.72,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 1723123,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "This plant is native to Peru, and when demand peaked some years ago, the price soared, making it unaffordable for local people.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 429.195,
                  "from": 418.68,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 1723146,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "While the popularity of quinoa has benefited farmers financially, there have been other negative consequences.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 437.98,
                  "from": 430.315,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 1723162,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "As demand grew, farmers began working the land all year round in order to produce more quinoa.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 445.98,
                  "from": 438.78,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 1723180,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "One issue has been that the fertility of the soil decreased dramatically, which could potentially lead to desertification in some areas.",
                "youpass_pick_words": [
                  "desertification"
                ],
                "meta": {
                  "to": 457.675,
                  "from": 447.275,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 1723201,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Another example would be the case of the…",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 462.485,
                  "from": 459.04498,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "listen_from": 1260,
        "listen_to": 1725,
