            "question_type": "GAP_FILLING",
            "question_count": 10,
            "content": "<h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Developing food trends</h3>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">- The growth in interest in food fashions started with <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_31\">______</span> of food being shared on social media.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">- The UK food industry is constantly developing products which are new or different.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">- Influencers on social media become &lsquo;ambassadors&rsquo; for a brand.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">- Sales of <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_32\">______</span> food brands have grown rapidly this way.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">- Supermarkets track demand for ingredients on social media.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">- Famous <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_33\">______</span> are influential.</p>\n<p><strong>&nbsp;Marketing campaigns</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">- The avocado:</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">+ <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_34\">______</span> were invited to visit growers in South Africa.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">+ Advertising focused on its <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_35\">______</span> benefits.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">- Oat milk:</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">+ A Swedish brand&rsquo;s media campaign received publicity by upsetting competitors.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">+ Promotion in the USA through <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_36\">______</span> shops reduced the need for advertising.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">+ It appealed to consumers who are concerned about the <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_37\">______</span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">- Norwegian skrei:</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">+ has helped strengthen the <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_38\">______</span> of Norwegian seafood</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Ethical concerns</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">- Quinoa:</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">+ Its success led to an increase in its <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_39\">______</span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">+ Overuse of resources resulted in poor quality <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_40\">______</span></p>",
